### Terraform (infra/terraform/, ADR-010) ###
# State and lock info: never committed, may contain resource attribute values.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Local plugin/module cache.
**/.terraform/*
# Saved plan output: may contain sensitive values from resource attributes.
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Variable files: may contain values that shouldn't be public. Only *.example
# files (committed, no secrets) document the expected shape.
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# Partial backend config: real bucket/table names, filled in locally per
# infra/terraform/environments/production/backend.hcl.example.
backend.hcl
# terraform.tfvars is committed only as terraform.tfvars.example (see that
# file per stack) — the real file, if a contributor creates one, stays local.
terraform.tfvars
terraform.tfvars.json
# CLI history that can leak workspace/variable names.
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

### HTTP Client (http/, IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client) ###
# Local tokens/keys filled in from http/http-client.env.json.example — never committed.
http/http-client.private.env.json